  "body": "### Description\n\nThis is kind of hard to track or reproduce but apparently after upgrading to 1.63.1, Synapse out of the blue randomly stops sending events to our Bifrost instance AS.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Unreproducible, but happened at least twice in 2 days\n\n### Homeserver\n\naria-net.org\n\n### Synapse Version\n\n1.63.1\n\n### Installation Method\n\nDebian packages from packages.matrix.org\n\n### Platform\n\nRunning on a VM with Ubuntu 20.04 LTS with 16 threads and 50GB of RAM.\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\nNone useful\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n_No response_",
